<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38920" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prŏpĭtĭo</span></b> ,
			āvi, ātum, 1
		(prōpĭtĭo, Ven. Fort. S. M. 4, 163;
		Prud. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφ</span>. 3, 211), v. a.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to render favorable</i>, <i>to appease</i>, <i>propitiate</i> (ante-class. and post-Aug.; cf.
			placo), Pac. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 111, 20</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Venerem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Poen. 1, 2, 120</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">manes Galbae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Oth. 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Jovem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Curt. 4, 13, 15</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">4, 7, 24</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 95, 50</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val. Max. 1,
				1, 1</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">propitiata Juno per matronas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac.
					A. 15, 44</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">numina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					15, 30, 40, § 135</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">suum genium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. Or. 9</span></i>
			.—<i>Pass.</i>, <i>to be
				propitious</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">propitietur vobis Dominus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Lev. 23, 28</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>to atone for</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">de propitiato peccato,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. Ecclus. 5, 5</span></i>
			.</div>
